  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.93 Walker Pond. No person shall operate a motorboat with more than 6 horsepower on Walker Pond, in the towns of Boscawen and Webster.\n\nSource. #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.732); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.85) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
